{"title": "Multiattack: Prone (Glut)", "pageid": 27888, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Prone_(Glut)", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Prone</b> is a passive feature that allows a creature to attack more than once when attacking an enemy that is <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Sovereign Glut can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Glut)\" title=\"Multiattack (Glut)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Glut)\" title=\"Multiattack (Glut)\">Multiattack</a> against a target that's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Glut</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035617\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 916/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4815/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2328/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643694/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTrans